{"3713470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Moonvile", "steam_appid": 3713470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hunt Begins</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moonvile is an asymmetrical PvP game for up to 12 players where Hunters and Wizards face off. The goal of the Hunters is to hunt down the Wizards before they can open the portals. Wizards, on the other hand, attempt to escape this dark land by collecting hidden books and items across the map to open the portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each game, you make a choice: Become a Hunter, and chase down your opponents to eliminate them… or become a Wizard, and use your wits to survive and escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/cd766a3bc41beafdb3336e7696b1ac3e.poster.avif?t=1778380765\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/cd766a3bc41beafdb3336e7696b1ac3e.webm?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/cd766a3bc41beafdb3336e7696b1ac3e.mp4?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>What Do Wizards Do?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizards collect magic books and potions scattered across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic books</strong> represent the abilities of the Wizards. By using these books, you can defend yourself and fight back against the Hunters. <strong>Potions</strong> are the key to opening the portals. Every potion you gather from the environment fills the Magic Power bar. When the bar is completely full, the portals open, revealing an escape route from Moonvile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★ At the start of the game, the amount of Magic Power required to open the portals can be set by the host.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/e9e993804e5c8793981cdc96a1e91a71.poster.avif?t=1778380765\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/e9e993804e5c8793981cdc96a1e91a71.webm?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/e9e993804e5c8793981cdc96a1e91a71.mp4?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Do Hunters Do?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective of the Hunters is to prevent the Wizards from opening the portals and escaping, and to hunt them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning of the game, they choose their own set of spells based on the map. They play with this spell set and their chosen character throughout the match. They stop and capture the Wizards, eliminating them by placing them in the Soul Furnace.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/792c2369a2515264ab80ea7a85e15b3f.poster.avif?t=1778380765\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/792c2369a2515264ab80ea7a85e15b3f.webm?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/792c2369a2515264ab80ea7a85e15b3f.mp4?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Moon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blood Moon is a special, recurring event during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blood Moon begins when there are 50 seconds of silence. During this time, the Wizards' vision is restricted, and their heartbeats become audible to the Hunters. This makes the Wizards easy targets. Hiding is useless in this phase; Wizards must fight to survive. During the Blood Moon, magic books and potions disappear completely and do not return until the Blood Moon ends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/4707f938b627a65542524b800aa229fc.poster.avif?t=1778380765\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/4707f938b627a65542524b800aa229fc.webm?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/4707f938b627a65542524b800aa229fc.mp4?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>The Soul Furnace</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Furnaces are places where Hunters can imprison Wizards. When a Wizard is imprisoned in a Soul Furnace, if they remain there for too long, they are eliminated permanently, never to return.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/4c818e33ccc0827eec83f7d9378cb73c.poster.avif?t=1778380765\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/4c818e33ccc0827eec83f7d9378cb73c.webm?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/4c818e33ccc0827eec83f7d9378cb73c.mp4?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there is still hope: They can be rescued if other Wizards help before time runs out. If a Hunter lingers near the Soul Furnace for too long, the pressure may allow the Wizard to break free by their own will. The Soul Furnace is the Hunters' most powerful weapon and the Wizards' greatest fear.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/cd040948c9a8984fba47b9d24320ab9b.poster.avif?t=1778380765\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/cd040948c9a8984fba47b9d24320ab9b.webm?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/cd040948c9a8984fba47b9d24320ab9b.mp4?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Hunt Begins</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moonvile is an asymmetrical PvP game for up to 12 players where Hunters and Wizards face off. The goal of the Hunters is to hunt down the Wizards before they can open the portals. Wizards, on the other hand, attempt to escape this dark land by collecting hidden books and items across the map to open the portals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each game, you make a choice: Become a Hunter, and chase down your opponents to eliminate them… or become a Wizard, and use your wits to survive and escape.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/cd766a3bc41beafdb3336e7696b1ac3e.poster.avif?t=1778380765\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/cd766a3bc41beafdb3336e7696b1ac3e.webm?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/cd766a3bc41beafdb3336e7696b1ac3e.mp4?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>What Do Wizards Do?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wizards collect magic books and potions scattered across the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magic books</strong> represent the abilities of the Wizards. By using these books, you can defend yourself and fight back against the Hunters. <strong>Potions</strong> are the key to opening the portals. Every potion you gather from the environment fills the Magic Power bar. When the bar is completely full, the portals open, revealing an escape route from Moonvile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >★ At the start of the game, the amount of Magic Power required to open the portals can be set by the host.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/e9e993804e5c8793981cdc96a1e91a71.poster.avif?t=1778380765\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/e9e993804e5c8793981cdc96a1e91a71.webm?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/e9e993804e5c8793981cdc96a1e91a71.mp4?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What Do Hunters Do?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective of the Hunters is to prevent the Wizards from opening the portals and escaping, and to hunt them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the beginning of the game, they choose their own set of spells based on the map. They play with this spell set and their chosen character throughout the match. They stop and capture the Wizards, eliminating them by placing them in the Soul Furnace.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/792c2369a2515264ab80ea7a85e15b3f.poster.avif?t=1778380765\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/792c2369a2515264ab80ea7a85e15b3f.webm?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/792c2369a2515264ab80ea7a85e15b3f.mp4?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blood Moon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blood Moon is a special, recurring event during the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Blood Moon begins when there are 50 seconds of silence. During this time, the Wizards' vision is restricted, and their heartbeats become audible to the Hunters. This makes the Wizards easy targets. Hiding is useless in this phase; Wizards must fight to survive. During the Blood Moon, magic books and potions disappear completely and do not return until the Blood Moon ends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/4707f938b627a65542524b800aa229fc.poster.avif?t=1778380765\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/4707f938b627a65542524b800aa229fc.webm?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/4707f938b627a65542524b800aa229fc.mp4?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>The Soul Furnace</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soul Furnaces are places where Hunters can imprison Wizards. When a Wizard is imprisoned in a Soul Furnace, if they remain there for too long, they are eliminated permanently, never to return.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/4c818e33ccc0827eec83f7d9378cb73c.poster.avif?t=1778380765\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/4c818e33ccc0827eec83f7d9378cb73c.webm?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/4c818e33ccc0827eec83f7d9378cb73c.mp4?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But there is still hope: They can be rescued if other Wizards help before time runs out. If a Hunter lingers near the Soul Furnace for too long, the pressure may allow the Wizard to break free by their own will. The Soul Furnace is the Hunters' most powerful weapon and the Wizards' greatest fear.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/cd040948c9a8984fba47b9d24320ab9b.poster.avif?t=1778380765\" width=800 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/cd040948c9a8984fba47b9d24320ab9b.webm?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713470/extras/cd040948c9a8984fba47b9d24320ab9b.mp4?t=1778380765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Moonvile is an asymmetric PvP game that you can play with your friends, for 2 to 12 players. Become a Hunter and hunt your friends, or become a Mage and work together to open the portals and escape from this dark realm.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, S